&lt;span class="gd"&gt;--
&lt;/span&gt;       289 rows,    0 levels,    0 internal,      1 leaf,   0.02 MB,  99%, last insert:    WAL: records=2 bytes=143     Buffers: shared hit=2
290 rows,    0 levels,    0 internal,      1 leaf,   0.02 MB,  99%, last insert:    WAL: records=2 bytes=143     Buffers: shared hit=2
