&lt;span class="gi"&gt;+     1259 rows,    1 levels,    1 internal,      6 leaf,   0.06 MB,  72%, last insert:    WAL: records=3 bytes=3799    Buffers: shared hit=5 dirtied=1 written=1
+     1260 rows,    1 levels,    1 internal,      6 leaf,   0.06 MB,  72%, last insert:    WAL: records=2 bytes=143     Buffers: shared hit=3
&lt;/span&gt;      1261 rows,    1 levels,    1 internal,      6 leaf,   0.06 MB,  72%, last insert:    WAL: records=2 bytes=143     Buffers: shared hit=3
1262 rows,    1 levels,    1 internal,      6 leaf,   0.06 MB,  72%, last insert:    WAL: records=2 bytes=143     Buffers: shared hit=3
1263 rows,    1 levels,    1 internal,      6 leaf,   0.06 MB,  72%, last insert:    WAL: records=2 bytes=143     Buffers: shared hit=3
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;This pattern continues until, in this test, the root page is full of downlinks to 291 leaf pages, so that it must be split into two internal pages, with a new root above, increasing the level to 2:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight diff"&gt;&lt;code&gt;     61343 rows,    1 levels,    1 internal,    291 leaf,   2.29 MB,  72%, last insert:    WAL: records=2 bytes=143     Buffers: shared hit=3
