&lt;span class="gi"&gt;+    61411 rows,    2 levels,    3 internal,    293 leaf,   2.32 MB,  72%, last insert:    WAL: records=3 bytes=3775    Buffers: shared hit=6 dirtied=1 written=1
+    61412 rows,    2 levels,    3 internal,    293 leaf,   2.32 MB,  72%, last insert:    WAL: records=2 bytes=143     Buffers: shared hit=4
&lt;/span&gt;     61413 rows,    2 levels,    3 internal,    293 leaf,   2.32 MB,  72%, last insert:    WAL: records=2 bytes=143     Buffers: shared hit=4
61414 rows,    2 levels,    3 internal,    293 leaf,   2.32 MB,  72%, last insert:    WAL: records=2 bytes=143     Buffers: shared hit=4
