&lt;h3&gt;


14.3 E-commerce product grid (skeleton)
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product grid with responsive columns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Filters (category, price)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add-to-cart UI (Zustand store)&lt;/li&gt;
